></path></svg></button><ul class=\"mt-1 ml-[30px] space-y-0.5 border-l border-border pl-3\"><li><a class=\"block rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-[13px] transition-colors text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary\" href=\"/portal/services/insurance\">Insurance</a></li><li><a class=\"block rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-[13px] transition-colors text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary\" href=\"/portal/services/captain-crew\">Captain &amp; Crew</a></li><li><a class=\"block rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-[13px] transition-colors text-gold\" href=\"/portal/services/berth-marina\">Berth &amp; Marina</a></li><li><a class=\"block rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-[13px] transition-colors text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary\" href=\"/portal/services/engine-boat\">Engine &amp; Boat Service</a></li></ul></li></ul></nav><div class=\"border-t border-border px-4 py-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gold-muted text-sm font-semibold text-gold\">JD</div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"truncate text-sm font-medium text-text-primary\">James Donovan</p><p class=\"truncate text-xs text-text-secondary\">james@donovan.com</p></div></div></div></aside><main class=\"ml-60 flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"mb-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><a class=\"text-gold transition-colors hover:text-gold-hover\" href=\"/portal/services\">Services</a><span class=\"text-text-secondary\">/</span><span class=\"text-gold\">Berth &amp; Marina</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-8\"><h1 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-cormorant)] text-3xl font-semibold text-text-primary\">Berth &amp; Marina</h1><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary\">Premium moorage options in the Seattle area. Jeff Brown Yachts customers receive priority access and preferred rates at our designated marina locations.</p></div><div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-gold/30 bg-gold/5 px-5 py-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star h-4 w-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gold\">JBY Customer Preference — Priority placement at designated marina locations</p></div><div class=\"mb-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-card\"><div class=\"h-44 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-700 via-blue-900 to-slate-800\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary\">Elliott Bay Marina</h3><div class=\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-text-secondary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Puget Sound, Seattle WA</div><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary\">Premier deepwater marina on the shores of Elliott Bay with stunning views of the Olympic Mountains. Full-service facility with experienced staff, concierge services, and easy access to downtown Seattle.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-6\"><div><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary\">1,200+</p><p class=\"text-xs text-text-secondary\">Total Slips</p></div><div><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary\">30-130ft</p><p class=\"text-xs text-text-secondary\">Vessel Size</p></div><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-emerald-400\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400\"></span>Slips Available</div></div></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-card\"><div class=\"h-44 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-800 via-teal-900 to-slate-700\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary\">Leschi Marina</h3><div class=\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-text-secondary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Lake Washington, Seattle WA</div><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary\">Sheltered freshwater marina on beautiful Lake Washington. Protected moorage with calm waters, ideal for year-round storage. Minutes from the I-90 bridge and Mercer Island.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-6\"><div><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary\">140+</p><p class=\"text-xs text-text-secondary\">Total Slips</p></div><div><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary\">20-80ft</p><p class=\"text-xs text-text-secondary\">Vessel Size</p></div><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-emerald-400\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400\"></span>Slips Available</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"mb-5 font-[family-name:var(--font-cormorant)] text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary\">Marina Amenities</h2><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-border bg-bg-card px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-4 w-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg>Shore Power</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-border bg-bg-card px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-droplets h-4 w-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 16.3c2.2 0 4-1.83 4-4.05 0-1.16-.57-2.26-1.71-3.19S7.29 6.75 7 5.3c-.29 1.45-1.14 2.84-2.29 3.76S3 11.1 3 12.25c0 2.22 1.8 4.05 4 4.05z\"></path><path d=\"M12.56 6.6A10.97 10.97 0 0 0 14 3.02c.5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5s3 3.5 3 5.5a6.98 6.98 0 0 1-11.91 4.97\"></path></svg>Fresh Water</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-border bg-bg-card px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wifi h-4 w-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2 8.82a15 15 0 0 1 20 0\"></path><path d=\"M5 12.859a10 10 0 0 1 14 0\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 16.429a5 5 0 0 1 7 0\"></path></svg>Wi-Fi</span><span class=\"flex items-c